s to take down your enemies!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/extras/bf9fc99d8edd4ad07e49f8e080d5a508.poster.avif?t=1783413316\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/extras/bf9fc99d8edd4ad07e49f8e080d5a508.webm?t=1783413316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/extras/bf9fc99d8edd4ad07e49f8e080d5a508.mp4?t=1783413316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Experience the story of the divided Renan and Dahnan people</strong><br>The protagonists who will determine the fate of these two worlds are Alphen and Shionne. They will overcome hardships and grow together with their unique group of friends. Gorgeous animation by ufotable is inserted at key points in the story, adding more color to our protagonists’ journey.", "short_description": "300 years of tyranny. A mysterious mask. Lost pain and memories. Wield the Blazing Sword and join a mysterious, untouchable girl to fight your oppressors. Experience a tale of liberation, featuring characters with next-gen graphical expressiveness!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/9031a1f4e34e8031118594726762d7979e43f320/header.jpg?t=1783413316", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/3c17579d4d76ad1cb7a40c5402a99da0fb478e91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783413316", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/74013